{"seq":2,"slug":"physics","title":"物理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics","introMarkdown":"# 物理 简介\n\n大学物理从牛顿力学的系统化表述出发，逐步深入到电磁理论、热力学和统计物理的精致框架，进而跨越到量子力学和相对论这两根支撑现代物理学大厦的支柱。与高中物理侧重定性理解和简单计算不同，大学物理要求用严格的数学语言描述自然规律，并从少数基本原理出发推导出广泛的物理现象。\n\n自学者进入大学物理的最大感受往往是数学要求的陡然升高。微积分、线性代数、微分方程和概率论不再是可选的辅助工具，而是物理思维的内在组成部分。麦克斯韦方程组将电磁现象统一为四个偏微分方程，薛定谔方程用复数波函数描述微观粒子的行为——理解这些方程的物理含义，是大学物理学习的核心目标。\n\n第一章**经典物理**涵盖分析力学、电动力学和热力学统计物理三大支柱，建立对宏观物理世界的完整理论描述。第二章**近代物理**探讨量子力学和相对论如何在二十世纪初彻底革新了物理学的基本图景，以及原子核物理学的基本框架。第三章**凝聚态物理**关注固体和液体中大量粒子集体行为的规律，是半导体技术和超导现象的理论基础。第四章**前沿物理**介绍粒子物理、天体物理和量子信息等当代最活跃的研究方向。\n\n建议以经典力学和电磁学为起点，在扎实掌握经典理论后再进入量子力学。学习过程中重视物理图像的建立——每一个数学推导背后都有一个物理故事，找到这个故事是真正理解物理的标志。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-physics","title":"经典物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/classical-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-mechanics","title":"大学物理 — 经典力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/classical-physics/classical-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electromagnetism","title":"大学物理 — 电磁学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/classical-physics/electromagnetism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"thermodynamics","title":"大学物理 — 热力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/classical-physics/thermodynamics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-physics","title":"近代物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/modern-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-mechanics","title":"大学物理 — 量子力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/modern-physics/quantum-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"special-relativity","title":"大学物理 — 狭义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/modern-physics/special-relativity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"general-relativity","title":"大学物理 — 广义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/modern-physics/general-relativity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"condensed-matter","title":"凝聚态物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/condensed-matter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solid-state-physics","title":"大学物理 — 固体物理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/condensed-matter/solid-state-physics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-mechanics","title":"大学物理 — 统计力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/condensed-matter/statistical-mechanics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"superconductivity","title":"大学物理 — 超导与超流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/condensed-matter/superconductivity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontier-physics","title":"前沿物理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/frontier-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"particle-physics","title":"大学物理 — 粒子物理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/frontier-physics/particle-physics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"astrophysics","title":"大学物理 — 天体物理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/frontier-physics/astrophysics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-information","title":"大学物理 — 量子信息","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/physics/frontier-physics/quantum-information"}]}]}